  "title": {
   "en": "Yarinaoshi Oujo no Madou Kakumei ~Shokei Sareta Akuyaku Reijou wa Horobiru Kamon wo Tate Naosu~"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "やり直し公女の魔導革命～処刑された悪役令嬢は滅びる家門を立てなおす～"
   },
   {
    "en": "The Reborn Princess's Magical Revolution ~The Executed Villainess Rebuilds the Perishing Noble Family~"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Mitsuki is an engineer living a smooth and successful life, working in robot development. Since she was little, she has repeatedly dreamed of the execution of Lady Leticia.\n\nOne day, after having the same dream as usual, she gets into a car accident and is reincarnated as Leticia.\nTo avoid the worst future, she decides to first find a way to avoid an engagement with the prince, who may be the cause of it all...\n\n(Source: ComicPolca, edited)\n\n___\nAlternative Raw: [Piccoma (JP ONLY)](https://piccoma.com/web/product/163623), [niconico](https://manga.nicovideo.jp/comic/70074)",
   "ja": "ロボット開発に携わり順風満帆な人生を送るエンジニア。彼女は小さい頃から令嬢・レティシアが処刑されるまでの夢を繰り返し見ていた。\nいつものように夢を見たある日、彼女は交通事故に遭いレティシアに転生してしまう。\n最悪の未来を回避するため、まず元凶の可能性がある王子との婚約を避ける方法を探ることに…。"
  },
